  "limits": "Synthetic XLS mechanics on the exact installed CPU candidate; fallback vectors do not qualify encoders or semantic quality. Active-process Job refusal occurs at native process creation; exact AssignProcessToJobObject fault remains covered by matching source regression, not injected into the installed binary. IsProcessInJob reports any job, not its private quota; peak metric is PROCESS_MEMORY_COUNTERS.PeakPagefileUsage. Native memory refusal, timeout, owner closure and overflow are directly observed. An early restart log captured a stale marker; per-case observer used the verified fresh owner, and auxiliary final installed readback waits for a changed marker. Its first invalid IPC doc-id payload and initial frozenset repr comparison failure are retained; corrected readbacks pass. No personal data, plan execution, publication or power-loss qualification."
